@startuml
left to right direction
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram

actor Editor
actor Player
actor ProductOwner

Editor --> (UC1-Create Map)
Editor --> (UC2-Add Industry)
Editor --> (UC3-Add City)
Editor --> (UC4-Create Scenario)

(UC1-Create Map) --> (Define Map Size)
(UC1-Create Map) --> (Set Map Name)
(UC2-Add Industry) --> (Specify Position XY)
(UC3-Add City) --> (Indicate Coordinates XY)
(UC3-Add City) --> (Set City Name)
(UC3-Add City) --> (Define House Blocks)
(Set City Name) --> (No Special Characters/Digits)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Must be Positive)
(Define House Blocks) --> (Manually or automatically around the city)

Player --> (UC5-Build Station)
Player --> (UC6-Upgrade Station)
Player --> (UC7-View Station Details)
Player --> (UC8-Build Railway Line)
Player --> (UC9-Buy Train)
Player --> (UC10-Assign Train to Route)
Player --> (UC11-List Trains)

(UC5-Build Station) --> (Check Overbuilding)
(UC8-Build Railway Line) --> (Select Registered Stations)
(UC9-Buy Train) --> (Select Locomotive from List)
(UC10-Assign Train to Route) --> (Choose Valid Stations)
(UC11-List Trains) --> (Group by Locomotive Type)
(UC11-List Trains) --> (Sort Alphabetically)

ProductOwner --> (UC12-Cargo Generation Simulator)
(UC12-Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Generate Cargo at Stations)
(UC12-Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Consider Cities and Industries)
(UC12-Cargo Generation Simulator) --> (Provide Start/Pause Option)


@enduml
